{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/ax28rz","slideIndex":0,"layout":{"id":"ly/qd4vmlgj","name":"Blank"},"title":"AI 下一個最大贏家？為什麼我看好博通！","textShapes":1,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kn6tcbqp","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":28,"width":1480.44,"height":110},"name":"main-title","text":"AI 下一個最大贏家？為什麼我看好博通！","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":60,"typeface":"Noto Sans TC","color":"#0C1B2F","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/2p83mxwn","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"保羅原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/oralo7et","slideIndex":0,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"AI 投資背景帶到下一個受惠者"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ax28rz","slideIndex":0,"text":"AI 的發展，讓科技大廠不斷投入資金，擴大運算能力。講到這波投資的受惠者，大家最熟悉的就是賣 AI 晶片的輝達。但大廠持續加碼，接下來還有哪些公司，有機會成為這一輪的大贏家？今天我想聊的是博通，一家做晶片和企業軟體的公司。為什麼我看好它，甚至認為它有機會成為 AI 下一個最大贏家？"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/v3n9up","slideIndex":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/qd4vmlgj","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 2","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/ex0rmhkn","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"保羅原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/10rqhwjy","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"博通的兩大業務與資料中心角色"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/v3n9up","slideIndex":1,"text":"博通主要有兩大業務：晶片，以及幫企業管理電腦資源的軟體。這次 AI 帶來的成長機會，主要在晶片這一塊。它的客戶會建置資料中心，也就是集中擺放大量電腦、進行運算的地方。博通則提供這些電腦需要的晶片和資料傳輸設備。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/mec0wk","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/qd4vmlgj","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 3","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/618f6l83","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"保羅原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/tozy1g7u","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"客戶提出需求，博通協助落實"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/mec0wk","slideIndex":2,"text":"在晶片開發上，客戶和博通各有分工。客戶知道自己的 AI 要做哪些工作，也能決定晶片該怎麼設計；博通則協助把設計做成實際可用的晶片。可是，大廠為什麼願意花資源開發自己的晶片？這就和它們每天使用 AI 的成本有關。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/ireegb","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/qd4vmlgj","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 4","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/7qdw7qt0","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"保羅原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/8rmxgval","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"每次使用 AI 都產生運算成本"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ireegb","slideIndex":3,"text":"像我們每次請 AI 回答問題，背後的電腦就要運算、產生答案，這個過程叫推論。使用者愈多，這些運算就會不斷累積。對大型 AI 公司來說，除了服務好不好用，也要考慮每次回答花多少錢。因此，降低運算成本，就成了一個很實際的需求。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/p07qz6","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/qd4vmlgj","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 5","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/zyd0jup4","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"保羅原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/0zmhsz6p","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"專用晶片配合特定工作，追求效率"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/p07qz6","slideIndex":4,"text":"客製化 AI 晶片，就是針對客戶常做的工作來設計，希望用更有效率的方式完成運算。對客戶的吸引力在於，如果能把大量重複運算做得更省電、更有效率，長期下來就有機會降低成本。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/fhd6o1","slideIndex":5,"layout":{"id":"ly/qd4vmlgj","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 6","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/bmxojad8","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"保羅原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/wn6psfet","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"前期開發投入和大量使用的取捨"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fhd6o1","slideIndex":5,"text":"不過，開發晶片也要先付出成本。使用量夠大，後面累積的節省，才值得前面的投入。所以，這門生意特別適合有大量運算需求的大客戶。對博通來說，這些公司願不願意投入開發，就會影響它能取得多少合作機會。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/pxxrsu","slideIndex":6,"layout":{"id":"ly/qd4vmlgj","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 7","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/tkzqdw3a","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"保羅原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/6x8rihkj","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"OpenAI 與博通的實際合作分工"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/pxxrsu","slideIndex":6,"text":"推出 AI 聊天工具 ChatGPT 的 OpenAI，就是一個例子。今年 6 月，它和博通發表專用的 AI 晶片，由 OpenAI 提出設計，博通協助把設計做成實際產品。這讓前面說的分工具體了起來。而這類需求，究竟已經替博通帶來多少生意？我們可以從財報看到。"}
